  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 1003.06 Application Processing and Decision",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 1003.06 Application Processing and Decision.\n\n(a) The department shall review each application for HWCF monies for HHW collection projects to determine whether it contains all the information and documents required by Env-Hw 1003.05.\n\n(b) If the application does not contain all information and documents required by Env-Hw 1003.05, the department shall notify the applicant of what is missing.\n\n(c) The department shall approve an application if it contains all of the information and documents required by Env-Hw 1003.05.\n\n(d) If an application is approved, the applicant shall be eligible to receive HWCF monies in the form of a grant award pursuant to Env-Hw 1003.07 through Env-Hw 1003.10.\n\nSource. #5053, eff 1-24-91; ss by #5886, eff 8-26-94; ss by #7333, eff 8-1-00; ss by #9215, INTERIM, eff 8-1-08; ss by #9367, eff 1-28-09; ss by #12352, eff 8-14-17 (formerly Env-Hw 1003.03); ss by #14284, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-hw1000.html"
